title: Nutanix Prism: VM Tools (API v4)
agents: nutanix
catalog: virtual/nutanix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check shows the actual status of the VM Tools on the Nutanix VM.
 The desired state of the tools can be configured through the corresponding rule.

 For running VMs with installed and enabled tools the service goes WARN if
 the tools are not reachable from the CVM (e.g. VSS snapshots will fail). This
 is skipped if the tools enable state is set to "ignored" in the rule. If a
 newer version of the tools is available, this is shown as information.

 This check requires the Nutanix Prism special agent for API v4 (agent_prism_v4).

discovery:
 One service is created.
